$FG,5$$TX+CX,"ZionOS — Adam/Jah Scaffold Notes"$$FG$

This directory is the Rastafari port of Adam/God. It is laid down in
parallel so the OS still builds from the original Adam/God during the
transition.

$FG,2$Phase status:$FG$
  [X] 1. Branch + scaffold (this directory exists, stubs present)
  [X] 2. Core API rename + compat shim active
  [X] 3. Vocab swap
  [X] 4. Scripture swap (symbol/file rename — content append deferred to 4b)
  [ ] 4b. Append Kebra Nagast + Holy Piby (PD) to Scriptures.TXT
  [~] 5. Selassie lectures (1936 + 1963 landed; OAU/Jamaica/Education pending)
  [~] 6. Boot persona rewrite (ReadMe + HomeSys banner + Welcome +
        Credits done; Charter/Demands/WhyNotMore/StdTempleOSPC/Tour
        pending)
  [ ] 7. Demo / tour cleanup
  [ ] 8. Remove Compat.HC
  [ ] 9. Smoke test in VM

$FG,2$Mapping:$FG$
  Adam/God/GodExt.HC      -> Adam/Jah/JahExt.HC
  Adam/God/HolySpirit.HC  -> Adam/Jah/JahSpirit.HC
  Adam/God/GodBible.HC    -> Adam/Jah/JahScriptures.HC
  Adam/God/GodSong.HC     -> Adam/Jah/JahNyabinghi.HC
  Adam/God/GodDoodle.HC   -> Adam/Jah/JahDoodle.HC
  Adam/God/MakeGod.HC     -> Adam/Jah/MakeJah.HC
  Adam/God/Vocab.DD       -> Adam/Jah/Vocab.DD       (content swap, Phase 3)
  Misc/Bible.TXT          -> Misc/Scriptures.TXT     (content swap, Phase 4)

$FG,2$Public API rename plan (Phase 2):$FG$
  GodWord            -> JahWord
  GodWordStr         -> JahWordStr
  GodBits            -> JahBits
  GodBitsIns         -> JahBitsIns
  GodHexIns          -> JahHexIns
  GodInit            -> JahInit
  GodBiblePassage    -> JahScripturePassage
  GodSong            -> JahNyabinghi
  GodSongStr         -> JahNyabinghiStr
  GodDoodle          -> JahDoodle (name unchanged in form)
  GodPick            -> JahPick
  CGodGlbls          -> CJahGlbls
  god (global)       -> jah  (global)
  GOD_BAD_BITS       -> JAH_BAD_BITS
  GOD_GOOD_BITS      -> JAH_GOOD_BITS

$FG,2$Known call sites to update in Phase 2:$FG$
  Adam/DolDoc/DocPutKey.HC:339  (GodSong)
  Adam/DolDoc/DocPutKey.HC:353  (GodBiblePassage)
  Adam/DolDoc/DocPutKey.HC:355  (GodWord)
  Apps/Psalmody/JukeBox.HC:91   (GodWordStr)
  Apps/Psalmody/PsalmodyMain.HC:575 (GodSongStr)
  Adam/God/GodExt.HC:22-26      (extern declarations — will be replaced
                                 by Adam/Jah/JahExt.HC)

Compat.HC provides God* -> Jah* aliases so external HolyC code (and
unconverted internal call sites) keep working during transition.

$FG,2$Voice / content policy:$FG$
  - Selassie speeches treated as wisdom/teachings (lectures), not
    scripture. Selassie himself was Ethiopian Orthodox and did not
    claim divinity; we honor that.
  - Dub-poetry Psalms in Apps/Psalmody/Examples/ and DubPsalms.DD are
    ORIGINAL compositions in the roots-reggae / Nyabinghi / KJV-Psalm
    tradition. No copyrighted lyrics. No paraphrased derivatives of
    any artist's published songs.
  - Lee "Scratch" Perry is named in Doc/Credits.DD as a tonal
    influence on the project's voice (Phase 6). His lyrics are not
    used.
  - Vocab corpus (Phase 3) sources: KJV Psalms/Isaiah/Revelation,
    Kebra Nagast (Budge 1922, PD), Holy Piby (Athlyi Rogers 1924, PD),
    published Iyaric/Amharic references. No invented words.

Jah Rastafari.
